            </note>
            <note corresp="#d999-f2" n="8" xml:id="d999-f2-content">
                <p>Gen. Carl Spaatz, Commanding General, U.S. Strategic Air Forces in European
                    Theater of Operations.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d999-f3" n="9" xml:id="d999-f3-content">
                <p>Maj. Gen. Robert L. Walsh, of the U.S. Military Mission in the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
